[{"title":"江城","author":"刘克逊","text":"过了元宵景自佳，东风轻拂酒旗斜。\n江城可是春先到，已有盈街卖杏花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":31040,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送杨帅","author":"刘克逊","text":"累诏登华省，当时已避踪。\n身闲名转重，道大世难容。\n南国因锄薤，东山得倚筇。\n何当投劾去，短褐许相从。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":31041,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寿枢使","author":"刘克逊","text":"喧喧文价握灵蛇，凛凛词锋挺镆铘。\n出遇万年天子圣，生从七叶侍中家。\n君臣相悦同鱼藻，兄弟连荣比棣华。\n岁岁重三前六日，寿觞何惜泛流霞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":31042,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寿异宪","author":"刘克逊","text":"元气钟为一代英，天休节后是公生。\n撑肠何止五千卷，满腹犹藏十万兵。\n懒向仕途为佞熊，肯将祠秩倦闲情。\n芹溪不是横舟处，四海风波正要平。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":31043,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寿泉使","author":"刘克逊","text":"新春三九左弧垂，惟有东皇造化知。\n不为等闲花柳计，独应长养栋梁姿。\n擎天一柱宁论价，伴月孤根永不移。\n自昔中书贵多考，愿公难老过□期。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":31044,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏兰","author":"赵以夫","text":"一朵俄生几案光，尚如逸士气昂藏。\n秋风试与平章看，何似当时林下香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":31045,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"黄陵庙","author":"黄棐","text":"潇湘江头三月春，柳条弄日摇黄金。\n鹧鸪一声在何许，黄陵庙前烟霭深。\n丹青欲画无好手，稳提玉勒况今久。\n马蹄不为行客留，心挂长林屡回首。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":31046,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"览友庄子文稿","author":"赵时弥","text":"信手拈来语不惊，纵横漫与笔端呈。\n独崇尔雅追先辈，肯竞铅华逐后生。\n至宝何曾营琢削，神工自是谢锄耕。\n一篇三复还堪味，不觉今人解性灵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":31047,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"隐求斋 其二","author":"林汝砺","text":"朝同猿鸟吟，暮与麋鹿游。\n吾生有良愿，舍此当安求。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":31048,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题武夷仙掌岩","author":"林汝砺","text":"汉武升遐几度春，金茎事迹总无闻。\n悬崖更不承朝露，空印纤纤十指纹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":31049,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题钱明仲汲古堂","author":"陈梦庚","text":"自一而三散万殊，学惟定力是功夫。\n十分谨处持槃水，万理紬来似辘轳。\n痴叔床空唯易在，濂溪阁冷有图无。\n希天穷到渊渊地，子肯闲来拥地炉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":31050,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"初度客中有感","author":"陈梦庚","text":"越舄长吟有所思，生空照社老空痴。\n一千馀尺拔文笔，三十六湾深墨池。\n人物要当天地意，溪山不欠晋唐诗。\n渊明子美成何事，牢落生涯寄酒卮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":31051,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"灯夕","author":"陈梦庚","text":"人生能看几番灯，强倚灯花听竹声。\n玉管吹残梅外雪，星毬撰出雨边晴。\n人行香雾不知夜，儿傲饥雷看到明。\n梦破春风感留滞，老书移就短长檠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":31052,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"心耻奉檄","author":"陈梦庚","text":"日月孔兼孟，尘埃申与韩。\n合于三尺法，行矣一分宽。\n火伞不遮热，冰壶独枕寒。\n平反了无几，足迹略高安。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":31053,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"汉祀坛","author":"陈梦庚","text":"苔老坛荒扫不开，汉皇多欲岂仙才。\n乘龙人去真图失，万里空劳一使来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":31054,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"仙茶灶","author":"陈梦庚","text":"尽夸六椀便仙灵，得似仙山石乳清。\n此水此茶须是灶，无人肯说与端明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":31055,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"武夷山","author":"陈梦庚","text":"看了图经看旧碑，怪奇多是说秦时。\n当时人会秦王意，可是建山称武夷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":31056,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"唐刻石","author":"陈梦庚","text":"长忆唐从天宝初，开元气象了无馀。\n宫中已制霓裳曲，刻石山灵失笑渠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":31057,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"武夷大隐屏","author":"陈梦庚","text":"大隐屏前风月闲，何人手种万琅玕。\n深深五曲东流水，合作千年洙泗看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":31058,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"武夷仙浴堂","author":"陈梦庚","text":"神仙无垢骨犹香，底用山间开浴堂。\n我欲从之三洗髓，骑鲸散发水云乡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":31059,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"武夷大小廪石","author":"陈梦庚","text":"白石青霞为岁计，佳殽旨酒出仙壶。\n侵天有廪无支遣，岁恶还能赈贷无。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":31060,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"自刘真人庵上登飞云","author":"陈梦庚","text":"列仙坛上碧鸡鸣，布袜青鞋取次行。\n上界烟霞疑可到，东方草木渐知名。\n一泓沧海杯浮景，万点青山棋落枰。\n脚底云飞寒带雨，此身知是在蓬瀛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":31061,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"仙船","author":"陈梦庚","text":"此船何事架岩隈，不遂浮槎八月来。\n莫是飞仙无所用，乘风有路到蓬莱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":31062,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"幔亭峰","author":"陈梦庚","text":"山中别是一桃源，綵屋虹桥影不存。\n山下人痴犹自说，排檐元是武夷孙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":31063,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"仙鼓楼","author":"陈梦庚","text":"求仙曾误几英雄，祇为沉迷利欲中。\n安得楼头一声鼓，顿教凡世醒盲聋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":31064,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"西湖置酒短歌","author":"尤煜","text":"春云薄，淡将落。\n我心良与然，浩荡杳无著。\n黄鸟枝头语太工，可能唤起东坡翁。\n眼前妙景供妙咏，钧天吹下乘长风。\n醉而复醒醒复醉，香山居士今安在。\n濡首狂歌无限情，一齐付与云山外。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":31065,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"被命出镇淮西至任","author":"尤煜","text":"万籁无声意转豪，一挥出守敢云劳。\n臣心耿耿依三殿，予发垂垂有二毛。\n月黑星光悬帐幕，夜深霜气满弓刀。\n披衣秉烛终宵坐，待旦乘时演豹韬。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":31066,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"早朝步葛元哲韵","author":"吴渊","text":"万井苍凉欲曙天，禁钟声断佩声联。\n云浮玉辇霞裾降，风动金莲宝炬然。\n四国龙飞清穆世，群工虎拜太平年。\n吾王不倦宵衣念，国祚遥知永永传。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":31067,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九日","author":"吴渊","text":"百年王事谩劳形，客里逢时迹类萍。\n无酒可添元亮兴，任人浪笑阮宣醒。\n荆湖城壁连钲鼓，河朔黎元陷虏庭。\n久拥旌旄愧无补，敢将衰朽叹飘零。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":31068,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"登南城","author":"吴渊","text":"江城一眺思悠悠，平楚苍然野水流。\n衰草寒烟梅老墓，败垣斜日谢公楼。\n江山有恨英雄老，天地无私草木秋。\n万古兴亡俱是梦，丈夫何者为身谋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":31069,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游青山 其一","author":"吴渊","text":"碧嶂千层镇一州，十年前记作斯游。\n因看红杏行停辔，为濯清泉坐解裘。\n怪石巉岩蹲虎豹，老松偃蹇卧龙虬。\n转看转有无穷景，杖履何妨绝顶头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":31070,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游青山 其二","author":"吴渊","text":"风流千载忆玄晖，此日登临不觉疲。\n看取眼前都是句，如何身后不留诗。\n须知小隐徜徉日，正是高吟寥泬时。\n可惜出山终不免，空留翠岫与清漪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":31071,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"横碧堂","author":"吴渊","text":"十一年如一欠伸，今朝又得快登临。\n半城杨柳春风满，四野桑麻雨露深。\n槛外翠峰重入眼，樽前白发遂惊心。\n感今怀昔凭栏处，不觉崦嵫日已沈。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":31072,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"用前韵","author":"吴渊","text":"每来登眺便眉伸，高处苍穹俨若临。\n投老光阴随日晚，思归情绪与秋深。\n鹭飞沙际迷人目，雁满江头动客心。\n北望淮淝何处是，晚来烟雾正沈沈。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":31073,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"官梅亭","author":"吴渊","text":"畴昔花前屡举觞，重来鬓发已苍苍。\n未容篱菊成归隐，且向官梅作醉乡。\n每约松篁坚岁晚，肯随桃李竞春芳。\n东风二月无人惜，片片霏霏雪自香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":31074,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"霜蕤亭三首 其一","author":"吴渊","text":"正到春归恼客肠，荼蘼架上发孤芳。\n刘伶嗜酒名为酒，薛女餐香肌亦香。\n人已今朝衰鬓发，花犹昔日淡梳妆。\n十年陈迹浑如梦，徙倚阑干到夕阳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":31075,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"霜蕤亭三首 其二","author":"吴渊","text":"东皇为代是南薰，酝酿成花迥出尘。\n尽洗娇红春态度，独呈雅素雪精神。\n牵衣弱蔓如留客，入枕清香更恼人。\n月下星前曾醉插，肯容烦暑到冠巾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":31076,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"霜蕤亭三首 其三","author":"吴渊","text":"园丁编竹亦勤哉，老蔓纤条费剪裁。\n杳杳翠云深作洞，霏霏香雪簇成堆。\n玉虬飞下盘千尺，金爵携将饮百杯。\n说与此花狼籍后，园林杖履亦稀来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":31077,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挥麈堂二首 其一","author":"吴渊","text":"老守重来何所为，筑成台榭凿成池。\n绿深夜雨龟鱼远，红压春风莺燕迟。\n民乐轩墀偏少讼，官閒园圃自多诗。\n凤团啜罢投衾枕，梦觉花间日影移。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":31078,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挥麈堂二首 其二","author":"吴渊","text":"恋宿怀安物我齐，况兼两世四持麾。\n可怜园内乐成日，却被官中捉去时。\n李郭诗篇怀旧迹，欧梅歌舞怅新知。\n多应日后清宵梦，频到姑溪溪水湄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":31079,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送杜尚书赴行在","author":"吴渊","text":"龙德刚中道学优，洛中夫子尔同流。\n暂辞天府安边阃，又属轺车返帝州。\n万里长城唐李绩，百年勋业汉留侯。\n明朝回首秋江上，泰华岩岩天际头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":31080,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"冬雨","author":"吴渊","text":"坐来杂霰洒隆冬，痛饮那禁觱发风。\n却忆西枢承旨日，冒寒犹立大明宫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":31081,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"高氏小景","author":"吴渊","text":"地白天寒冻裂裘，何人乘艇下中流。\n披图孟浪不相识，疑是当年王子猷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":31082,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"凤凰台二首 其一","author":"吴渊","text":"暂因休暇得遨游，感慨樽前岁月流。\n长向此时忧徼塞，不知何日乐林丘。\n凤凰寂寂空留寺，鸿雁嗷嗷尚满洲。\n畴昔谪仙愁绝处，我来登眺更多愁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":31083,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"凤凰台二首 其二","author":"吴渊","text":"六朝旧迹作新游，王谢千年风尚流。\n但使时能开晋宋，只缘道不本轲丘。\n昏昏赤县神州地，渺渺白蘋红蓼洲。\n谁道天分南北限，人分南北至今愁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":31084,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"劝耕二首 其一","author":"吴渊","text":"细霭轻烟弄晚晴，聊驱小队出城闉。\n□将泉石膏肓疗，为识庐山面目真。\n古殿松篁无盛夏，斋厨笋蕨有馀春。\n道旁处处闻流水，一部笙篁更可人。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":31085,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"劝耕二首 其二","author":"吴渊","text":"铃斋日日簿书尘，不觉光阴暗里侵。\n忽见前山有花发，始知今岁已春深。\n边风尚有寒吹面，腊雪全无早系心。\n忧国忧民平日事，新来赢得白盈簪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":31086,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"峨眉山","author":"吴渊","text":"一带天分南北限，两眉烟锁古今愁。\n却思太白惊人句，影入平羌江水流。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":31087,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"江南麦","author":"释本真","text":"江南麦似草离离，胡马贪青隔岸嘶。\n惊得村翁多计较，旋樵桑苇缚疏篱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":31088,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赋吴门上元","author":"释本真","text":"村翁看了上元归，正是西楼月落时。\n誇道官衙好灯火，不知浑尔点膏脂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":31089,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题经略台","author":"张琮","text":"维攀白玉龙，曾上黄金台。\n指挥十二州，意气何快哉。\n江上只如旧，四面画图开。\n慨怀出奇略，何地不生才。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":31090,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"逍遥楼","author":"张琮","text":"神游八极表，乃是逍遥意。\n因之以名命，何取漆园吏。\n扁榜谁其书，太师龙蛇字。\n弹压南容筦，江山倍增气。\n心画如见人，像想用馀地。\n我来登斯楼，凛凛敬节义。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":31091,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"独秀峰","author":"张琮","text":"原隰驱驱过一冬，好山何处不相逢。\n层峦叠嶂分高下，翠霭晴岚晕淡浓。\n小至停车休作暇，迁来携酒款从容。\n千崖竞秀吾乡远，只在南容独秀峰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":31092,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"光福寺 其一","author":"朱士麟","text":"不辞暑汗透冠裳，亟拜灵祠为亢阳。\n与佛有缘凭佛力，于心无愧爇心香。\n崇朝霶霈施霖雨，千里欢欣饱稻粱。\n老吏两年蒙润泽，诗成借笔记僧房。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":31093,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"光福寺 其二","author":"朱士麟","text":"乍和便觉怯衣裳，且驻归舟傍夕阳。\n连日雨花多听雨，今年香积又炊香。\n幸凭佛力成因果，消得诗人咏稻粱。\n殽核已无尊有酒，就溪带水擘莲房。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":31094,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"曹娥江","author":"余晦","text":"男儿尽有移忠事，何处芳名不此侔。\n今日扁舟赋归去，心如秋月印江流。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":31095,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游澹山岩","author":"王子申","text":"坤灵擘罅天幻奇，一到仙凡觉两岐。\n处士清风存万古，诗翁雅句见当时。\n洞深不碍烟云逸，丹就那知日月迟。\n更上层台瞻佛像，愧无法语勘狐疑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":31096,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梨花山","author":"史宜之","text":"梨花飞雪满春山，错认寒梅露玉颜。\n几日登山寻乐境，香风满袖放船还。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":31097,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"季子庙","author":"史隽之","text":"千载江滨季子宫，联镳款谒骤西风。\n清名长逐秋潮壮，遗迹应随夕照空。\n管领物华输酒圣，平章古意属诗翁。\n想君岸帻风尘表，笑我埋头雁鹜中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":31098,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"君山","author":"史隽之","text":"酾酒临江望石湾，松风引上白云关。\n潮吹海雨来无际，帆遂天风去不还。\n千仞振衣聊遣兴，一江如带敢偷闲。\n老怀抚事偏多感，莫拮中原几点山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":31099,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"大涤洞天留题","author":"曾槱","text":"梦想云根久已哉，青鞋布袜喜重来。\n笋添简寂春前盛，桃胜玄都观里栽。\n洞狭天宽多秀异，泉清石怪少尘埃。\n仙家日月长如许，我欲朝真屡往回。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":31100,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送胡秀昭谪象州","author":"谢郓","text":"燕雀群飞敞汉宫，惊闻伏马忽嘶风。\n洪恩大度祈三宥，乌府何颜奏一通。\n劲节敢攀丹陛槛，忠言应梦白头翁。\n象台一贬端然直，所幸身穷道不穷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":31101,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"穿岩","author":"王爚","text":"穿岩之峰高苍苍，峰峦十九摩天光。\n晨曦烜赫晹出岫，下望沧海何茫茫。\n有峰俛伏如鹅鼻，世说任公钓鱼地。\n缆舟凿石宛然存，海变桑田几千岁。\n泗洲俨然坐其中，右顾蒸饼香炉峰。\n普贤狮子出云来，笔架磬峰应覆钟。\n峰头有石平如席，仙子下棋有仙迹。\n云收帐暖见文殊，新妇蛾眉弄空碧。\n好似将军战胜归，摆旗卓剑逞雄威。\n又若子卿持汉节，幞头高耸立丹墀。\n或如骤马朝天阙，鼻孔撩天通日月。\n中有神人来隐居，老墨题诗犹未灭。\n断崖苍碧一线悬，崎岖有路如登天。\n松关竹坞杂秋色，稻田麦垄凝春烟。\n危楼杰阁建庵宇，石空神僧开山祖。\n八载跏趺不下山，冷眼死生犹旦暮。\n游人到此若登瀛，徙倚阑干鬼神惊。\n当年泻出天池水，犹是寻常瀑布声。\n山猿夜啼明月薄，听雪眠云犹未觉。\n五百真人应共归，天香桂子纷纷落。\n居民多在此山前，强寇陆梁宣和年。\n流毒数州民受苦，老稚登山获保全。\n谁知草莽英雄起，管领乡民皆效死。\n山上分为西南界，十万魔军犹睥睨。\n儒生谈笑觅封侯，胸中好算皆戈矛。\n深入贼巢谕恩信，渠魁乞伏如罪俘。\n上功幕府献天子，显立军功曳朱紫。\n生灵不作犬羊羞，民到于今受其赐。\n人心有感自不忘，从兹筑庵山之岗。\n千春万载奉祀事，愿祝生民长乐康。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":31102,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅花 其一","author":"江朝宗","text":"小小人家短短篱，冷香湿雪两三枝。\n寂寥竹外无穷思，正倚江天日暮时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":31103,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅花 其二","author":"江朝宗","text":"月淡霜清驿路长，一枝春信到江乡。\n西山饿死魂犹瘦，洛浦仙游佩亦香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":31104,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题式之诗卷后","author":"李义山","text":"老气棱棱未易攀，谊襟凛凛可廉顽。\n瘦筇只为江湖上，诗卷傍行天地间。\n社风雨花春正好，酒垆山屐梦相关。\n夔州已浚花绳削，今度编成不要删。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":31105,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题梅山云悦楼","author":"李义山","text":"云本无心悦者谁，华阳去后少人知。\n欲分半席无因到，一片飞来是觅诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":31106,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}}]